			<item>
				<title>arcR</title>
				<link>https://spatlyu.github.io/projects/arcr/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://spatlyu.github.io/projects/arcr/</guid>
				<description>&lt;img src=&#34;https://spatlyu.github.io/projects/projects-picture/arcR.png&#34; align=&#34;right&#34; height=&#34;30&#34;/&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;goal&#34;&gt;goal&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The goal of &lt;strong&gt;arcR&lt;/strong&gt; is to &lt;em&gt;integrate the benefits of R and ArcGIS with using ArcGIS in R&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;document&#34;&gt;document&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;You can see the document of &lt;strong&gt;arcR&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;a href=&#34;https://spatlyu.github.io/arcR/&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;source-code&#34;&gt;source code&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The source code of &lt;strong&gt;arcR&lt;/strong&gt; is in &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/SpatLyu/arcR/&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;feedback&#34;&gt;feedback&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;If you have any questions or suggestions, please post them in &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/SpatLyu/arcR/issues&#34;&gt;arcR github repo issue&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
